.</em></h1></div><p class=\"lead ph-a\">Managers who set the BEP, run the CDE and keep every discipline to the same standard.</p></div></section><section class=\"paper pad\"><div class=\"wrap sd\">\n  <div><p class=\"lab\">BIM Management</p><p class=\"big\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">BIM Managers placed onsite, remotely or as part of a dedicated team, <em>each one assessed before you meet them.</em></p>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:36px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/request-talent/?service=BIM%20Managers\">Request BIM Managers <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"sdside\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Roles we place</p><ul class=\"deliv\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><li>BIM Manager</li><li>BIM Lead</li><li>BIM Specialist</li><li>BIM QA/QC Engineer</li></ul></div></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">On the project</p><h2 class=\"h2\">What they <em>do for you.</em></h2></div></div>\n  <div class=\"qual qual-dark\">\n    <div class=\"rv ok\"><p class=\"lab\">Typical responsibilities</p><ul><li>Write and maintain the BIM Execution Plan</li><li>Set up CDE structure, workflows, permissions and status codes</li><li>Define LOD/LOI requirements and naming standards</li><li>Audit deliverables at each stage</li><li>Align information management with ISO 19650 principles</li></ul></div>\n    <div class=\"rv\"><p class=\"lab\">Software we assess</p><div class=\"chiprow ink-chips\"><span>ACC</span><span>ProjectWise</span><span>Solibri</span><span>Navisworks</span><span>Revit</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"rv\"><p class=\"lab\">How they can work</p><ul class=\"plain\"><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/onsite/\">Onsite BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/remote/\">Remote BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/outsourcing/\">BIM Resource Outsourcing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/dedicated-teams/\">Dedicated BIM Teams</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/staff-augmentation/\">BIM Staff Augmentation</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/mobilization/\">BIM Workforce Mobilization</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/workforce-continuity/\">BIM Workforce Continuity</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/temporary/\">Temporary BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/long-term/\">Long-Term BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/technical-recruitment/\">BIM Technical Recruitment</a></li></ul></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Need a package instead?</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Related <em>BIM services.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/bim-services/\">All BIM services <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/bim-services/bim-management/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Management</b><span>Management</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-services/bim-qa-qc/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM QA/QC</b><span>Assurance</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li></ul></div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"bone pad\"><div class=\"wrap faqx\"><div><p class=\"lab\">FAQ</p><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:18px\">Hiring <em>BIM Managers.</em></h2><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">Anything else? <a class=\"u\" href=\"/contact/\">Ask ENGISOFT.</a></p></div><div class=\"qa\"><details><summary>Do you work to ISO 19650?<i></i></summary><p>Workflows can be aligned to ISO 19650 information management principles. ENGISOFT does not claim formal certification unless independently verified.</p></details><details><summary>Can a BIM manager lead our in-house team?<i></i></summary><p>Yes. A BIM manager can be embedded to lead your team, or lead a dedicated ENGISOFT team.</p></details></div></div><